    "detailed_description": "\u201cLots of Cats in Every Moment\u201d is a game where you find hidden cats while romance unfolds!<br><br>A girl ends up raising a kitten after an unexpected event. What will occur because of this? Find the cats hidden in the beautiful and diverse hand-drawn landscapes and listen to their story, meow!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Over 1800 Cats and Special Items!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Part 1 (free): 5+1 main landscapes, 5 interactable comic strips, 650+ cats, 250 items<br></li><li> Part 2 (DLC): 5+1 main landscapes, 5 interactable comic strips, 650+ cats, 250 items</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> All comic strips and main landscapes are connected through story progression.<br></li><li> Hints can be used once per minute.<br></li><li> No penalty for clicking on a spot without a cat. Search freely.<br></li><li> Has an original soundtrack, with unique tracks featured in each episode. Another BGM set is also available, so you can choose the one that you like best.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080240/extras/995136d2ebf0ad3b39cd8dc7ee76b71b.poster.avif?t=1753187529\" width=580 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080240/extras/995136d2ebf0ad3b39cd8dc7ee76b71b.webm?t=1753187529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080240/extras/995136d2ebf0ad3b39cd8dc7ee76b71b.mp4?t=1753187529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080240/extras/7aeb2f41513906260574823496c301b7.poster.avif?t=1753187529\" width=580 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080240/extras/7aeb2f41513906260574823496c301b7.webm?t=1753187529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080240/extras/7aeb2f41513906260574823496c301b7.mp4?t=1753187529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
